OL,3,GNEWSAMasked men, lorries and road
OL,4,Ablocks: How anti-migrant activists are
OL,5,Achanging tactics
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt around seven o'clock last Saturday
OL,8,Fmorning, dozens of men dressed in black
OL,9,Fclimbed into the backs of lorries in a
OL,10,Fquiet Kent village called
OL,11,FPreston-next-Wingham.
OL,13,FThe men had arrived under cover of
OL,14,Fdarkness the night before, leaving
OL,15,Ftheir cars everywhere: in the village
OL,16,Fhall car park and on the recreation
OL,17,Fground.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
