OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMasked men, lorries and road
OL,4,Ablocks: How anti-migrant activists are
OL,5,Achanging tactics
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn an operation with a degree of
OL,8,Fmilitary precision, the small fleet of
OL,9,Florries departed for Dover just after
OL,10,Fsunrise, where the men staged an
OL,11,Fintimidating show of strength near the
OL,12,Fport.
OL,14,FIn disciplined, serried ranks, they
OL,15,Fwore paramilitary-style balaclavas as
OL,16,Fthey blocked roads around the port.
OL,17,FThere were at least three waves of
OL,18,Farrivals, including the men who had
OL,19,Fspent the night in
OL,20,FPreston-next-Wingham. Glaring ominously
OL,21,Fat motorists and police officers, they
OL,22,Fstood their ground.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
